# Optional. Localbots runs fine without this file.
#
# With Blizzard API credentials the Armory tab reads characters live from the
# real Armory: current gear, every saved talent loadout, and item icons that
# work even for items added by the newest patch. Without them it falls back to
# a free public scan, which is a little behind and has fewer talent builds.
#
# Get a client id and secret (free) at https://develop.battle.net/access/clients
# Then: cp .env.example .env  and fill these in. .env is gitignored — keep it
# that way, and never share the secret.
BLIZZARD_CLIENT_ID=
BLIZZARD_CLIENT_SECRET=
